Traffic generation uses Eclipse SUMO 1.28.0, EPL-2.0 (GPL v2 or later secondary
license option). No SUMO binary or library is bundled in the app.
https://eclipse.dev/sumo/docs/Downloads.html
The bundled result actually uses SUMO on an OSM network, with an assumed signal
plan and demand, not observed vehicle trajectories. No simple-model fallback
is silently substituted. The traffic clock pauses if pedestrian clearance
overruns; replay wrap is a cut rather than continuous vehicle identities.

